  ('imo','01','Nt','Olympiad Mathematics: Number Theory','Number Theory','Mathematics',array['Olympiad','Mathematics']::text[],'Dr. Ananya Rao','IMO Silver · IISc Bangalore',2499,4999,4.9,'2.1k','12.4k',48,22,'Advanced','Grade 8–12','#0A1F4D','#3DD6CF',98,'Olympiad Mathematics: Number Theory is a carefully sequenced course by Dr. Ananya Rao. Every lesson pairs a short, beautifully produced video with worked examples and graded practice — built for students who want depth, not shortcuts.',array['Build intuition for divisibility, primes and modular arithmetic','Solve olympiad problems with invariants and extremal arguments','Write clean, rigorous proofs examiners love','Pace yourself through 3-hour papers']::text[]),
